    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Starships_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are a master at using multiple starship tactics over the course of long space combats.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Tactics\" title=\"Starship Tactics\">Starship Tactics</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicular_Combat\" title=\"Vehicular Combat\">Vehicular Combat</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You regain all spent <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers\" title=\"Starship Maneuvers\">Starship Maneuvers</a> at the end of any round in which you roll a Natural 20 on an attack roll.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> Only a Natural 20 rolled on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> check to activate a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuver\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship Maneuver\">Starship Maneuver</a> restores all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship_Maneuvers\" title=\"Starship Maneuvers\">Starship Maneuvers</a>.</p>",
